        "html": "<div class=\"wrap\" style=\"position:relative;min-height:600px;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden;\">\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;\">\n    <img src=\"/assets/placeholder/hero-impact-bg.svg\" alt=\"\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:0.35;\" />\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(105deg,#1E1710 45%,#2E2418 100%);\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:80px 32px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:80px;align-items:center;width:100%;\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;\">\n      <span style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C8924A;\"># Claude 코스 · 코어 캠퍼스</span>\n      <h1 style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(44px,5.5vw,72px);font-weight:900;line-height:1.08;color:#F5F0E8;letter-spacing:-0.03em;margin:0;\">지금 당장<br><span style=\"color:#E8C87A;\">가격 페이지를</span><br>바꾸십시오</h1>\n      <p style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#C4B8A8;margin:0;max-width:400px;\">방문자는 가격 페이지에서 <strong style=\"color:#F5F0E8;\">평균 8초</strong> 안에 떠납니다. Claude로 설계한 전환 구조 하나가 그 8초를 바꿉니다.</p>\n      <hr style=\"border:none;border-top:1px solid #3A3020;margin:4px 0;\" />\n      <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;\">\n        <div style=\"padding:18px 20px;background:#2E2418;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #3A3020;\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:28px;font-weight:900;color:#E8C87A;line-height:1;\">8초</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#C4B8A8;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.4;\">방문자가 가격 페이지에 머무는 평균 시간</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"padding:18px 20px;background:#2E2418;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #3A3020;\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:28px;font-weight:900;color:#E8C87A;line-height:1;\">1개</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#C4B8A8;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.4;\">전환 구조가 필요한 전부 — 긴 글 불필요</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding-top:8px;\">\n        <a href=\"#enroll\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:18px 36px;background:#C8924A;color:#1E1710;font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;letter-spacing:0.01em;\">수강 신청하기</a>\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#7A6E60;\">· 지금 바로 시작 가능</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;\">\n      <div style=\"padding:28px;background:#2E2418;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #3A3020;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:#C8924A;margin-bottom:16px;text-transform:uppercase;\">이런 분께 필요합니다</div>\n        <ul style=\"margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;\">\n          <li style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:#C4B8A8;line-height:1.55;\"><span style=\"flex-shrink:0;color:#E8C87A;margin-top:1px;\">→</span>가격 페이지를 올렸는데 문의가 없다</li>\n          <li style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:#C4B8A8;line-height:1.55;\"><span style=\"flex-shrink:0;color:#E8C87A;margin-top:1px;\">→</span>할인 없이는 결제가 안 된다고 느낀다</li>\n          <li style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:#C4B8A8;line-height:1.55;\"><span style=\"flex-shrink:0;color:#E8C87A;margin-top:1px;\">→</span>글을 써도 '설득력'이 없는 것 같다</li>\n          <li style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:#C4B8A8;line-height:1.55;\"><span style=\"flex-shrink:0;color:#E8C87A;margin-top:1px;\">→</span>마케팅 공부할 시간이 없다</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:20px 24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2E2418,#1E1710);border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #C8924A44;\">\n        <p style=\"font-size:13px;font-style:italic;color:#C4B8A8;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 10px 0;\">&ldquo;한 번 배워서 모든 상품 페이지에 쓸 수 있는 구조를 갖게 됐어요.&rdquo;</p>\n        <small style=\"font-size:11px;color:#7A6E60;font-weight:600;\">— 온라인 강의 창업 6개월 차 수강생</small>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
